Subject: [PATCH net 2/3] net: hns: Restart autoneg need return failed when autoneg off
Date:   Sat, 26 Jan 2019 17:18:26 +0800
Message-ID: <1548494307-63594-3-git-send-email-lipeng321@huawei.com>
